  "whatsapp": {
    "about": "WhatsApp's forms of the generic contracts: the installation is <waba_id>:<phone_number_id>, one per connected business number; a person is their business-scoped user id (BSUID: a country code, a period and up to 128 characters; never the phone number), which the external id pattern admits as it is, no hash in between; a 1:1 chat is a direct place named by the BSUID, a group a channel named by its group id; the session uid is hostSessionUid(\"whatsapp\", [waba_id, phone_number_id, user_id]) for a chat and [waba_id, phone_number_id, group_id] for a group; a turn's provenance names the message by its wamid.",
